# The Best of Both Worlds with Peter Parker's Camera copying chapter I: on turn 3 the chapter I trigger aims at one of Bot2's
# Kobolds of Kher Keep and, with it on the stack, Bot1 pays {2} and a film counter to copy it, choosing the other Kobolds for
# the copy. Both are assimilated (Bot1 controls two 1/2 Borg with a +1/+1 counter). Chapter III on turn 7 reads both from the
# history, not one remembered object: it exiles and returns both under Bot2's control with their printed characteristics
# (CR 607.3, 608.2c, 400.7).

